The target is a PROFESSIONAL, ENTERPRISE-GRADE, PRODUCTION-READY PHILIPPINE ERP SYSTEM.

This application must reliably handle thousands of business records and transactions without incorrect computations, missing records, duplicate postings, broken relationships, data corruption, or inconsistent reports.

